---
---

<section class="dev-welcome">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="https://hackers.pub" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card">
      <span class="logo" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="/images/logos/fediverse/hackerspub.svg"
          alt="Hackers Pub"
          width="32"
          height="32"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </span>
      <div class="text">
        <span class="eyebrow">소프트웨어, 만드는 쪽에 관심 있나요?</span>
        <h3>코드와 시스템 이야기를 긴 글로 나누는 <b>hackers.pub</b>이 있어요.</h3>
        <p>devlog·오픈소스·삽질기까지, 개발하다 떠오른 생각을 편하게 풀어놓는 동네예요. 처음이라도, 읽기만 해도 환영이에요.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="cta">둘러보기 <span class="arr">→</span></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dev-welcome {
    padding: 8px 0 24px;
  }
  .dev-welcome .card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    background: var(--mint-soft);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--mint-deep) 18%, transparent);
    border-radius: 20px;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s,
      border-color 0.2s,
      box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .dev-welcome .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--mint-deep) 30%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -32px rgba(15, 21, 18, 0.18);
  }
  .dev-welcome .logo {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: white;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .dev-welcome .logo img {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }
  .dev-welcome .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--mint-deep);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .dev-welcome h3 {
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  .dev-welcome h3 b {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .dev-welcome p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .dev-welcome .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .dev-welcome .card:hover .arr {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .dev-welcome .arr {
    transition: transform 0.15s;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .dev-welcome .card {
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 16px 18px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .dev-welcome .cta {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
